Duck.ai said

Electron’s JavaScript package is installed, but its binary download step hasn’t completed—so path.txt is missing. Run Electron’s install script directly from the project root:

powershell


node .\node_modules\.bun\electron@42.3.0\node_modules\electron\install.js
When it finishes, try launching again:

powershell


bun run start:desktop
Electron’s install step downloads the binary needed to run the app. 
electronjs.org

