You’re right—the rebuild didn’t fix it. The log shows Node 22 couldn’t install because a newer Node is already present; you don’t need to downgrade Node. I sent you down the wrong path.

The error you started with means Electron’s binary download step hasn’t created path.txt. Run Electron’s installer from its own folder:

